cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these data, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "AB-MDP: simulation code, released numerical records and verification scripts"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction package for the Autonomic-Boundary Markov Decision Process (AB-MDP)
  framework: a bounded 2D navigation study comparing Lagrangian penalty relaxation
  against a robust one-step invariance filter, the released numerical records behind
  every reported figure and table, and the scripts that verify each number quoted in
  the manuscript against those records.
